$ eden-god place lamp-post --near well --count 4 --dist 2
  placed lamp-post [core/lamp-post@1] at (20.54, 0.22, 8.39) facing s — near well, se of it, 2 m away; keeps: near well
  placed lamp-post-2 [core/lamp-post@1] at (21.96, 0.1, 0.68) facing s — near well, ne of it, 2 m away; keeps: near well
